        "id": 1003873
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-24T08:59:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indexer(s) are not responsible for parsing configuration, their only responsibility is to perform reindexing. Configuration parsing is a responsibility of the scheduler which then schedules period indexers as configured. What may be a bit confusing here is that the configuration parsing provides backward compatibility with the old config style which makes the parsing code look more complex than it should be.",
